      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not that simple. it's not just some bills i can list out. it's my life. i look at my bank account and i just feel... empty. like there's no point in even trying to plan anything because the math never works out in my favor. i feel so cornered. like the walls are just closing in and i'm stuck in a loop i can't break.",
